<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“Tis by Thy blood we’ve been redeemed,</l><l>And by it sanctified.</l><l>Now is our conscience free from sin,</l><l>From dead works purified.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Better than Abel’s, now Thy blood</l><l>Speaks unto God for us.</l><l>Perfect redemption it provides,</l><l>Meeting God’s righteousness.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Through the eternal Spirit, Thou</l><l>Offeredst Thyself to God.</l><l>This sacrifice can ne’er grow old;</l><l>Timeless is Thy dear blood.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>’Tis by Thy blood we boldly come</l><l>Unto the throne of grace,</l><l>Unto our God, the cov’nant new,</l><l>And to the Holiest Place.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Lord, by Thy blood, God is obliged</l><l>His very Self to give;</l><l>He must receive us to Himself,</l><l>An He in us must live.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Dear Lord, how precious is Thy blood</l><l>Of the New Testament!</l><l>By it God’s blessings we receive,</l><l>And we with Him are blent.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
